BT 1 0 0 1 0 41.9 Tm /F1 9.3 Tf 12.8 TL (The tractive battery is configured as 108S4P, built from nine 12S4P modules \(~50 V per module\) using Reliance) Tj T* (INR21700-RS50 cylindrical cells \(switched from Molicel P45B this design cycle\). The BMS is a distributed architecture with) Tj T* (one slave board per module and a central master board, communicating over an isoSPI daisy chain. The system is) Tj T* (responsible for cell voltage and temperature monitoring, passive balancing, fault detection, and drive-event data logging.) Tj T* ET
