BT 1 0 0 1 0 65.7 Tm 12.5 TL /F2 9.3 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Thermistor sensing:) Tj /F1 9.3 Tf ( NMUX1308PW-Q100 analog multiplexer expands the LTC6811-1's GPIO inputs to scan multiple) Tj T* (thermistor channels per module. Each module is instrumented with one NTC thermistor per parallel cell group \(12) Tj T* (thermistors per module\), and hardware provisions for additional thermistors to monitor module case temperature are) Tj T* (included for a planned future addition to the BMS. As dictated by FSAE rules, a DS18B20 energy meter temperature) Tj T* (sensor is also included on the negative-most cell of each module, wired for parasite power \(Vdd tied to Gnd\) with) Tj T* (electrical isolation maintained between the sensor and the cell.) Tj T* ET
