BT 1 0 0 1 0 65.7 Tm 12.5 TL /F2 9.3 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Design correction \(inspection note\):) Tj /F1 9.3 Tf ( During bench testing of individual modules, the original resistor/fuse combination) Tj T* (held up fine. The nuisance fuse blows only appeared once multiple modules were connected together in series to form) Tj T* (the full tractive battery, where the steady-state balancing current pushed close enough to the fuse rating to trip it. Rather) Tj T* (than simply increasing the balance resistor value, the resistor and fuse values were re-sized together to arrive at a new) Tj T* (optimized combination \(33 ) Tj /F3 9.3 Tf 12.5 TL (W) Tj /F1 9.3 Tf 12.5 TL ( resistors with the 250 mA / 500 mA fuse scheme above\) that restores adequate margin at) Tj T* (full-pack operating conditions.) Tj T* ET
